Draft patch — PR #76 ignored files (CONFIRMED, verdicts.md item 42). worktree_is_dirty never lists ignored files, so an ignored-only worktree reported clean and git worktree remove silently deleted the ignored files (they exist in no commit). Adds worktree_has_ignored_files (--ignored=matching, '!!' entries) and refuses removal in both remove paths. Scoped to removal only: publish/retry dirtiness keeps its narrower meaning. Uncompiled in the authoring sandbox; run cargo check + git_runtime tests before landing; a regression test beside the worktree tests (~git_runtime.rs:1516) is recommended when landing.

